From ac6cc5bb06f167fe498384b242b5210e0768fba4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shreenidhi Shedi <shreenidhi.shedi@broadcom.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 06:46:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Drop mandatory configobj dependency

Make all configobj imports conditional using try/except so the package
can be imported without configobj installed. Replace the configobj-based
lease parser in net/dhcp.py with a minimal stdlib implementation. Skip
tests that exercise configobj functionality directly.

Signed-off-by: Shreenidhi Shedi <shreenidhi.shedi@broadcom.com>

Re-ported for cloud-init 26.2
Signed-off-by: Prashant S Chauhan <prashant.singh-chauhan@broadcom.com>

---
